  "notes": "BiDi pair: SO-SFP-10GE-BX10D-2733 (Tx/Rx 1270/1330 nm per footnote 1) and SO-SFP-10GE-BX10D-3327 (Tx/Rx 1330/1270 nm per footnote 2). Transmit wavelength 1260–1280 nm (2733) and 1320–1340 nm (3327); receiver wavelength ranges are swapped. Power budget 0–9 dB. Operating temperature also offered as I-temp -40°C to +85°C (ordering codes with -I suffix). Storage temperature -40°C to +85°C. Transmitter output power and receiver min input/overload are average power (footnote 3). Receiver minimum input power -14.0 dBm and overload +0.5 dBm at 10.3 Gbps, BER ≤ 1×10⁻¹², PRBS 2³¹-1, back-to-back (footnote 4). IEEE 802.3ae 10GBASE-LR/LW is defined only at 1310 nm; standard cited for bridgeable distance. Protocol support includes GbE, 10GbE-LAN, 10GbE-WAN, OTU1, OTU2, OTU2e, STM-64/OC192, STM-16/OC48, STM-4/OC12, 1G/2G/4G/8G/10G FC, CPRI Opt 1–8 and 7A, OBSAI 1x/2x/4x/8x. DDM per SFF-8472.",
